  "description": "A truly one of a kind bike. This Throwdown was custom painted by Fresh Paints of Whistler to complement our Special Edition Jade Cloud colour scheme. Silver accents pop against the Jade Cloud frame and components to give this a stand out but understated look. Top of the line RockShox Ultimate suspension front and rear offer the plushest and most balanced ride. A SRAM XO Transmission drivetrain with Maven Ultimate Special Edition Teal Splatter brakes complete this coveted build.\n\nWith 170 mm of rear travel and a mixed-wheel configuration, the Throwdown is built for riders who head straight into the chaos: steep chutes, blown-out corners, deep landings, and natural lines that keep the suspension working. The smaller rear wheel allows more travel with a compact, reactive rear end, giving the bike a grounded, confident feel without sacrificing agility.\n\nBuilt from premium 6066 alloy, the Throwdown is the first Chromag adult full-suspension frame made entirely from aluminum, carrying forward our trademark attention to detail in a new material with an emphasis on durability.",
